!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/class2/schema/invalid/a-required-field-typed-by-an-abstract-application-in-place-is-unsatisfiable-expected.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/schema-sidecar.tn"
{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §4.2, [TSON-SCHEMA] §5.10, [TSON-SCHEMA] §5.10.1"
  description: """
    `shape` states a selector, so each application is abstract, and `s: shape<circle>` closes in place to an abstract
    record nothing can be a member of: an empty type. `s` is required, so `plot` is unsatisfiable, a resolver error
    by the productivity rule. The closing loads, as an abstract record written in place does; it is the required
    field that is refused. `circle_shape => shape<circle>`, declared, is a base its members compose.
    """
  error: {
    category: resolver
  }
}
